value","2026-10-20T02:17:53.808Z","language","en","image","gameplay","Capture from the creator’s browser campaign.","src","/GameMap/media/learning/clowder-and-crest-agents.webp","alt","The cat guild’s explorable town and management interface.","https://clowderandcrest.com/","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","GameMap browser capture","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型","items",[87,88,89],"Claude Code","Codex","Gemini CLI","links","相关资源",[95,96,97],"resourceIds","section",{"_62":101,"_25":102},{"_62":99,"_25":100},{"_62":89,"_25":98},"/zh/resources/gemini-cli/","OpenAI Codex","/zh/resources/codex/","Phaser · First Game Guide","/zh/resources/phaser/","创作者开发记录",[106],"evidence",{"_62":107,"_25":108,"_109":110},"查看作者的多工具分工说明","https://github.com/JacobStephens2/clowder-and-crest#built-with","note","README names model/tool roles; todo/codex-todo.md and todo/gemini-todo.md are separate development lanes. These are project records rather than a complete prompt transcript.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[115],{"_62":116,"_25":117,"_109":118},"查看完整公会游戏项目","https://github.com/JacobStephens2/clowder-and-crest","Full Phaser campaign, fifteen minigame types, assets, native shells and tests. Install package dependencies, then npm run dev; the documented dev port is 3200. CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.","更多游玩入口",[122,123],"distribution",{"_62":127,"_25":128,"_109":129},{"_62":124,"_25":125,"_109":126},"GitHub Releases · iOS","https://github.com/JacobStephens2/clowder-and-crest/releases/tag/v2.7.3","Download — Older v2.7.3 IPA; iOS is not included in v2.8.0. Requires suitable signing and sideloading as described by the author, not direct App Store installation. Not installed in this review.","GitHub Releases · Android","https://github.com/JacobStephens2/clowder-and-crest/releases/tag/v2.8.0","Download — Signed v2.8.0 Android APK for sideloading. This is not a Google Play listing. Installer assets were verified; installation was not tested.","获取方式","playable","demo","试玩与运行",[135],{"_62":136,"_